               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The Law of Morale\n\nDo not stop after a single exercise. To reinforce what you have learned, practice until you feel more comfortable, and spread your practice over more than one day.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
