                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Heaven\n\nVisualize the numbers you are adding with your own body. Every time you add one number to another, check whether the result stays within the count of your fingers or goes beyond it. Then try to recreate the additions you are doing here in other scenarios, so you realize that the same idea appears everywhere.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
