         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### What Comes Next\n\nYou have learned the five factors of Sun Tzu: the law of morale, heaven, terrain, the commander, and method and discipline.\n\nIn the next classes, we will use these factors as a strategy for learning addition and other mathematical operations.",
